@guide H_BladesEdge
@name Blade's Edge Mountains (Thunderlord Stronghold)
@faction Horde
@levels 66-68
@zone Blade's Edge Mountains
@chapter Outland
@desc Thunderlord Stronghold, the Bloodmaul and Bladespire ogres, Evergrove, Mok'Nathal Village and Rexxar's chain.
@next Both_Netherstorm

fp Thunderlord Stronghold
bind Thunderlord Stronghold [area=3769]
accept The Bladespire Threat | Tor'chunk Twoclaws.
accept They Stole Me Hookah and Me Brews! | T'chali the Witch Doctor.
accept Killing the Crawlers | Grunt Grahk.
accept The Encroaching Wilderness | Gor'drek.
accept 10489 Felling an Ancient Tree
complete The Encroaching Wilderness
accept 10524 Thunderlord Clan Artifacts
complete The Bladespire Threat | Elite: Bladespire Sober Defender; bring help or skip.
complete 10489 Felling an Ancient Tree
complete They Stole Me Hookah and Me Brews! | T'chali's Hookah: loot T'chali's Hookah. Bloodmaul Brutebane Brew drops from Bloodmaul Brewmaster.
complete Killing the Crawlers
turnin The Encroaching Wilderness
accept Dust from the Drakes
turnin The Bladespire Threat
complete 10524 Thunderlord Clan Artifacts
turnin 10524 Thunderlord Clan Artifacts
accept The Bloodmaul Ogres
turnin Killing the Crawlers
complete Dust from the Drakes | Dust of the Fey Drake drops from Fey Drake.
complete The Bloodmaul Ogres
turnin The Bloodmaul Ogres
turnin They Stole Me Hookah and Me Brews!
accept Bladespire Kegger | Group quest: Bladespire Sober Defender is elite.
complete Bladespire Kegger | Elite: Bladespire Sober Defender; bring help or skip.
turnin Bladespire Kegger
turnin Dust from the Drakes
turnin 10489 Felling an Ancient Tree
accept Protecting Our Own
complete Protecting Our Own
turnin Protecting Our Own
accept A Time for Negotiation... | Tree Warden Chawn, Evergrove.
accept 10825 The Truth Unorbed [iffound] | Shown only if you find Orb of the Grishna.
turnin 10825 The Truth Unorbed [iffound]
turnin A Time for Negotiation...
accept ...and a Time for Action
accept Poaching from Poachers
accept Culling the Wild
accept Little Embers
accept From the Ashes
complete ...and a Time for Action
complete Little Embers
complete Poaching from Poachers | Wyrmcult Net drops from Wyrmcult Poacher.
complete Culling the Wild
turnin Poaching from Poachers
complete From the Ashes | Click Fertile Volcanic Soil.
turnin Culling the Wild
turnin Little Embers
turnin From the Ashes
turnin ...and a Time for Action
fp Evergrove
accept Mok'Nathal Treats [optional] | Matron Varah, Mok'Nathal Village.
complete Mok'Nathal Treats [optional] | Raptor Ribs drops from Bladespire Raptor, Bladespire Ravager and Daggermaw Lashtail and others. Serpent Flesh drops from Cobalt Serpent, Cobalt Serpent (1) and 
turnin Mok'Nathal Treats [optional]
fp Mok'Nathal Village
accept Silkwing Cocoons | Taerek, Mok'Nathal Village.
accept 10618 The Softest Wings
accept The Stones of Vekh'nir | Dertrok.
complete 10618 The Softest Wings
complete Silkwing Cocoons | Silkwing Cocoons from Silkwing Larvae in the same valley.
complete The Stones of Vekh'nir
turnin The Stones of Vekh'nir
accept Trial and Error
accept Understanding the Mok'Nathal | Leoroxx.
complete Trial and Error | Dullgrom Dredgers south-east of the village.
complete Understanding the Mok'Nathal | Vekh, south-east of the village.
turnin Trial and Error | Dertrok.
turnin Understanding the Mok'Nathal | Leoroxx.
turnin Silkwing Cocoons | Taerek.
turnin 10618 The Softest Wings
accept 10843 Since Time Forgotten... | Leoroxx.
accept The Totems of My Enemy | Spiritcaller Dohgar.
complete 10843 Since Time Forgotten... | Gnosh Brognat, west of the village.
complete The Totems of My Enemy | Bladespire Totems from Bladespire Crushers nearby.
turnin 10843 Since Time Forgotten...
turnin The Totems of My Enemy
accept Slay the Brood Mother | Leoroxx.
accept Spirit Calling | Spiritcaller Dohgar.
complete Slay the Brood Mother | Dreadwing, south of the village.
complete Spirit Calling | Lesser Nether Drake spirits from Lesser Nether Drakes in the same area.
turnin Slay the Brood Mother
turnin Spirit Calling
accept Gather the Orbs
complete Gather the Orbs | Razaani Light Orbs north of the village.
turnin Gather the Orbs
accept Inform Leoroxx!
turnin Inform Leoroxx!
level 68
note Fly to Area 52 in Netherstorm.
